	(footprint "Serenity-Custom:Pigtail_7W_DirectSolder"
		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "918f2ac0-16df-4561-bcb1-f53faadfc34c")
		(at 140.41 114)
		(descr "7-wire direct-solder pigtail lands, 0.6 x 2.2 mm SMD pads, 0.95 mm pitch. Pad numbers follow ENC-NACELLE-1 P1 pin order (1=GND 2=+3V3 3=SCLK 4=MOSI 5=MISO 6=CSN 7=ERROR); physical left-to-right order is 1,6,3,4,5,2,7 to minimise trace crossings. Epoxy strain relief over the soldered wires is REQUIRED (SMD wire pads peel). Authored for Serenity UAV by Claude Fable 5 (Anthropic), 2026-07-21; comments in ENC-NACELLE-1.md per project inline-comment policy.")
